  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PSD Strategy for the East African Community</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose  of the grant is to provide EAC with the financial support necessary to facilitate a consultative process both, at the country and the EAC level amongst relevant private and public sector organizations, including the governments of the EAC member countries. The grant would also finance capacity building and institutional development of the member-country governments as well as the EAC Secretariat through financing of training, courses and orientation programs for the staff and on-the-job training. The output of the grant is a  final draft PSD Strategy for EAC owned by the EAC member-countries. This strategy would recommend concrete implementable policies and programs promoting a private sector-driven growth in the East African Community and provide specific guidance to EAC policy makers on the policy agenda on matters relevant to PSD.</narrative>
  </description>
